   "title": "【7/11(土)】第３回夢らんまん祭り開催！",
   "html": "<p>\n\t７月１１日(土)デ・モーレンいまかねにて「第３回夢らんまん祭り」が開催されます！\n</p>\n<p>\n\t縁日・屋台コーナーのほか、豪華景品が当たる大ビンゴ大会もあります！\n</p>\n<p>\n\t皆さんのご来場をお待ちしています！\n</p>\n<p>\n\t日時：令和８年７月１１日（土）15：00～20：00\n</p>\n<p>\n\t場所：デ・モーレンいまかね(風車下)\n</p>\n<p>\n\t&nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-13168\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://ima-channel.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/c13c4c6be72da7910867bf5613430aed-496x700.jpg\" width=\"496\" srcset=\"https://ima-channel.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/c13c4c6be72da7910867bf5613430aed-496x700.jpg 496w, https://ima-channel.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/c13c4c6be72da7910867bf5613430aed-212x300.jpg 212w, https://ima-channel.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/c13c4c6be72da7910867bf5613430aed-768x1085.jpg 768w, https://ima-channel.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/c13c4c6be72da7910867bf5613430aed.jpg 991w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 496px) 100vw, 496px\" />\n</p>\n<p>\n\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-13175\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://ima-channel.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/8a6f792752912a2120dee4b717926cdd-503x700.jpg\" width=\"503\" srcset=\"https://ima-channel.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/8a6f792752912a2120dee4b717926cdd-503x700.jpg 503w, https://ima-channel.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/8a6f792752912a2120dee4b717926cdd-215x300.jpg 215w, https://ima-channel.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/8a6f792752912a2120dee4b717926cdd.jpg 680w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 503px) 100vw, 503px\" />\n</p>\n<p>\n\t&nbsp;</p>\n"
